{"title": "Promised Victory", "pageid": 28121, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Promised_Victory", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Promised Victory</b> is a passive feature that highlights enemies you hit.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>On a hit, possibly inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guiding_Bolt_(Condition)\" title=\"Guiding Bolt (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guiding Bolt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guiding_Bolt_(Condition)\" title=\"Guiding Bolt (Condition)\">Guiding Bolt</a> upon the target. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Guiding_Bolt\"> Condition: Guiding Bolt </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guiding_Bolt_(Condition)\" title=\"Guiding Bolt (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guiding Bolt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guiding_Bolt_(Condition)\" title=\"Guiding Bolt (Condition)\">Guiding Bolt</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save (DC&nbsp;15)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;15)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The next <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> made against this creature has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gontr_Mael\" title=\"Gontr Mael\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/Gontr_Mael_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gontr_Mael\" title=\"Gontr Mael\">Gontr Mael</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Promised Victory only applies 1 turn of Guiding Bolt, differing from the spell which applies 2 turns, and as such the condition is lost immediately at the start of the target's next turn.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Arrows\" title=\"Arrows\">Arrows</a> that have an area of effect can trigger Promised Victory on all creatures and objects within the area, spreading <a href=\"/wiki/Guiding_Bolt_(Condition)\" title=\"Guiding Bolt (Condition)\">Guiding Bolt</a> over multiple targets.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202012\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1678/1000000\n